  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Nitrous acid is produce when sodium nitrate is reacted with acid. The nitrous acid can produce nitrosonium ion as electrophile. The tertiary amine given undergoes electrophilic&nbsp;substitution reaction with electrophile. The para substituted product is formed as major product.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NaNO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>HX</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>NaX</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>NO</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/553dcf79-2a91-4f66-adc9-91dfaf26efbd.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 190px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Statement <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math> is incorrect</p>",
    "image": null
